Package: fleetcheck
Title: Twin-Fidelity Checks for the fleet Malaria Model
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Winskill", email = "p.winskill@imperial.ac.uk",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Measures how closely the fleet mean-field ODE model reproduces the
    malariasimulation individual-based model. Holds the claims register, the
    comparison statistics, and the code that produces the evidence behind each
    claim. This measures agreement between two models, not agreement with data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://pwinskill.github.io/fleetcheck, https://github.com/pwinskill/fleetcheck
BugReports: https://github.com/pwinskill/fleetcheck/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: stats, utils, yaml, jsonlite
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr, pkgload, fleet, malariasimulation, postie,
    ggplot2
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
